From: Nick Kennedy <local-experiment>
Subject: [PRIVATE 17/17] automatic stay-warped stereo profile

DXMT_STAY_WARPED=WIDTHxHEIGHT (with DXMT_RATE_MAP_POSITION, _READ and _ATTACHMENT_PROBE = 1)
binds one fixed two-peak map for the session; DXMT_STAY_WARPED_RATE sets the peripheral rate.
Adds mapped multi-target passes, compute-stage read translation, an ordinary pass for imported
(swapchain) targets, and a DXMT_DEBUG_DUMP_PATH image dump. No shader or size heuristics beyond
the explicit size; not a general game profile.
Also: per-pixel integer table for Load, and no translation for a same-map Load at the
pass's own pixel (int(SV_Position.xy) tracked within a basic block).

